<title>USA: Conseco completes Transport Holdings merger.</title>
<headline>Conseco completes Transport Holdings merger.</headline>
<dateline>CARMEL, Ind. 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Conseco Inc said it completed its merger with Transport Holdings Inc, which was merged into Conseco.</p>
<p>In the merger, each outstanding share of Transport common stock was converted into the right to receive 1.4 shares of common stock of Conseco, a financial services organization.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
